Rebuilt the list widgets and the provider icon upload on react-aria-components, as `@plone/components` is. Rows now reorder from the keyboard as well as by dragging, with the moves announced in the site's language, and each row's Edit and Delete buttons are named for its entry. A freshly chosen icon is previewed as an image instead of inlined, so a script in the file no longer runs in the editor's session before the backend sanitizes it. The same file can be chosen again after removing it, and a file name outside Latin-1 no longer drops the upload. The email list refuses an address that differs from one already listed only in case, and stores entries trimmed. Delete removes the entry it asked about even if the list changed meanwhile. @ericof
